OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic pellet clean-up resumes on
OL,4,Abeach
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge Taylor, Southern Water's
OL,7,Fdirector of wastewater operations, said
OL,8,Fthere was also a plan to continue work
OL,9,Fin Rye and for the clean-up to carry on
OL,10,Fthrough the winter.
